	"@id": "goal-card-system",
	"@context": "tb",
	"data": "Goal: Card System\n\nSkill nodes as discrete, collectible, tradeable cards. Pick up, place, and trade skill nodes by hand.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe UX metaphor for skill node acquisition — from Estia's fiction, directly into the spatial authoring environment. Instead of clicking \"add skill\" in a menu, you pick up a card from a deck and place it in your thought space.\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nCard deck — a spatial stack of available skill cards you can flip through\nPick up — grab a card from the deck…",
